      "name": "41427f5e",
      "displayName": "Matching Overview",
      "pageType": "PAGE_TYPE_CANVAS",
      "layoutVersion": "GRID_V1",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "intro",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## ATS Resume Matching Preview\n\n300 resumes · 2 job postings · TF-IDF and MiniLM. Scores show text similarity, not hiring probability. Exploratory preview; independent review is pending."
